'''Hunter's Map IV''' (狩人の地図Ⅳ, ''Karyūdo no Chizu Ⅳ'', '''Hunter's Map Ⅳ''') is an [[Enigma Stages|Enigma]] map that has five stages, each with a different color Behemoth Stone drop. Each stage also has a 40% chance to allow the player to try a [[Continuation Stage]] that can drop Behemoth Gems. Upon clearing any one stage in Hunter's Map IV, the map disappears until it is found again. It can only appear at Enigma Level 10, replacing [[Hunter's Map III]]. It was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]].

